sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant F as Frontend
    participant B as Backend
    participant D as DynamoDB
    participant O as OpenSearch
    participant L as Bedrock

    U->>F: Enter message
    F->>B: POST /api/v1/chat
    B->>D: Load/create session
    B->>O: Retrieve relevant FAQ docs
    O-->>B: Top documents
    B->>L: Send prompt with context
    L-->>B: Generated answer
    B->>D: Save conversation
    B-->>F: Response + citations
    F-->>U: Render answer